  <Docs>
    <summary>The contract between the Contacts Picker session provider and client applications.</summary>
    <remarks>
      <para>The contract between the Contacts Picker session provider and client applications. This contract defines the intent actions, extras, and URI structure used to interact with the Contacts Picker to select contacts and retrieve their data.</para>
      <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/provider/ContactsPickerSessionContract" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.provider.ContactsPickerSessionContract</code>.</a></format></para>
